{"availability":"available","full":"weaviate/weaviate","name":"weaviate","description":"Weaviate is an open-source vector database that stores both objects and vectors, allowing for the combination of vector search with structured filtering with the fault tolerance and scalability of a cloud-native database​.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":16891,"forks":1423,"created":"2016-03-30T15:03:17Z","updated":"2026-10-19T10:19:49Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://weaviate.io/developers/weaviate/","topics":["approximate-nearest-neighbor-search","generative-search","grpc","hnsw","hybrid-search","image-search","information-retrieval","mlops","nearest-neighbor-search","neural-search","recommender-system","search-engine","semantic-search","semantic-search-engine","similarity-search","vector-database","vector-search","vector-search-engine","vectors","weaviate"],"demo":"https://elysia.weaviate.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:46:42.995Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:46:42.995Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:46:42.995Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.390Z","stars":16876,"forks":1422},{"at":"2026-10-15T12:58:27.602Z","stars":16884,"forks":1420},{"at":"2026-10-19T11:46:42.995Z","stars":16891,"forks":1423}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Weaviate is a cloud-native vector database that stores both objects and vectors, enabling semantic search at scale. It combines vector similarity search with keyword filtering, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), and reranking in a single query interface. Common use cases include RAG systems, semantic and image search, recommendation engines, chatbots, and content classification.","Weaviate supports two approaches to store vectors: automatic vectorization at import using integrated models (OpenAI, Cohere, HuggingFace, and others) or direct import of pre-computed vector embeddings. Production deployments benefit from built-in multi-tenancy, replication, RBAC authorization, and many other features.","To get started quickly, have a look at one of these tutorials:"],"features":["Quickstart - Weaviate Cloud","Quickstart - local Docker instance"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8dc0086a08ce896fca55ed99881694a5baae63a4e671489cb98c3e6a07da096a","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.515Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.515Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Weaviate is a cloud-native vector database that stores both objects and vectors, enabling semantic search at scale. It combines vector similarity search with keyword filtering, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), and reranking in a single query interface. Common use cases include RAG systems, semantic and image search, recommendation engines, chatbots, and content classification.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8dc0086a08ce896fca55ed99881694a5baae63a4e671489cb98c3e6a07da096a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.515Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T15:13:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:13:05.406Z","hash":"8dc0086a08ce896fca55ed99881694a5baae63a4e671489cb98c3e6a07da096a","originalBytes":19636,"storedBytes":19636,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:47.390Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:12.870Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.40.0 - Alter Schema Drop Vector Index, HFresh MUVERA, RQ-4 quantization","tag":"v1.40.0","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T06:58:25Z","url":"https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/releases/tag/v1.40.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:12:12.870Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/d649f0622924aec0229a5411.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026